  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/IMG_2265.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Aquest dissabte, 10 de desembre, Tales ha celebrat el Mercat Tradicional de Nadal, inaugurat per l&#39;lacalde, Vicente Juan Prades Ramos, i el president de la Mancomunitat Espad&agrave; Millars, Jos&eacute; Mart&iacute; Garcia. Han participat el Dol&ccedil;ainers i Tabaleters de Tales, els Tambors i Bombos, i el Grup Scout Verge del Carme, amb diverses activitats, aix&iacute; com el grup de teatre Am&iacute;mic d&#39;Onda. Tamb&eacute; s&#39;han ferrat cavalls en directe.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercattradicionaltales2016/img_2220.jpg\" alt=\"img_2220\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercattradicionaltales2016/img_2222.jpg\" alt=\"img_2222\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercattradicionaltales2016/img_2223.jpg\" alt=\"img_2223\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercattradicionaltales2016/img_2224.jpg\" alt=\"img_2224\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercattradicionaltales2016/img_2226.jpg\" alt=\"img_2226\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercattradicionaltales2016/img_2227.jpg\" alt=\"img_2227\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercattradicionaltales2016/img_2228.jpg\" alt=\"img_2228\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercattradicionaltales2016/img_2229.jpg\" alt=\"img_2229\" style=\"max